@startuml sdd-03_contribution_render
title SDD-03 — A surface renders contributions (UML **sequence diagram**)\nOne factory contributed to two surfaces yields two independent cards — each with its own Presenter and Coordinator — sharing only the module's feed.
autonumber
participant "TradingModule" as TM
participant "ContributionRegistry" as Reg
participant "Surface(trading)" as ST
participant "Surface(dev_board)" as SD
participant "PageShell" as PS
participant "make_positions_card\n(lazy factory in modules/trading/ui)" as F
participant "PositionsCard #1\nView + Presenter + own Coordinator" as C1
participant "PositionsCard #2\nView + Presenter + own Coordinator" as C2
participant "OrderFeed / PositionRefreshService\n(trading application singletons)" as Feed

== contribute (once, at boot; no widget module imported) ==
TM -> Reg : add(Descriptor(contributor="trading", surface="trading", place=RAIL, order=10, factory=make_positions_card))
TM -> Reg : add(Descriptor(contributor="trading", surface="dev_board", place=RAIL, order=10, factory=make_positions_card))
note over TM, Reg : one factory, two places (§4.6 rule 2): one CLASS, two INSTANCES

== navigate to trading (first time — surfaces are built once and kept) ==
ST -> Reg : for_place("trading", RAIL)
Reg --> ST : stable sort by (order, contributor_id, factory.__qualname__)
loop each descriptor
  ST -> F : factory(container)   <<main thread only>>
  F -> C1 : construct View, Presenter(view, container)\nPresenter builds LiveOrderBookCoordinator + ActionOwnershipTracker
  C1 -> Feed : subscribe via the Presenter's own QtEventBridge
  ST -> PS : rail.add(view, size_hint)
end
note right of PS : geometry decided by the place:\nrail width fixed, cards stack, size_hint → min height

== navigate to dev_board (dev.mode only) ==
SD -> Reg : for_place("dev_board", RAIL)
SD -> F : factory(container)
F -> C2 : a second, independent card
C2 -> Feed : subscribe — both cards update from the SAME feed, through SEPARATE presenters
SD -> Reg : for_place("dev_board", DEV_PROBE)
SD -> PS : probes.add(exchange_api_tester)
note over C1, C2 : No Coordinator, Presenter or widget is ever in the DI container\n(ADR D12, async-ui-action-rule §2). Shared truth = feeds and events.
@enduml
